RQ5 (Adversarial Resilience and Failure Doctrine): What are the failure modes of an AI-governed water system—including sensor spoofing, model drift, optimization gaming, Goodhart's Law effects, institutional capture, and cyber-physical attack—and what layered defense mechanisms are required?

RQ6 (Equity and Validation): What is the Pareto frontier between aggregate water productivity and distributional equity (Gini coefficient of water access) under AI-governed allocation, and how does the proposed architecture perform against historical counterfactuals and existing policy baselines?

